  "invariants": [
    "NativeUI ABI 1 retains its 520-byte prefix; optional control_perform_click appends at byte 520, new size 528. Size-checked loader forwarding returns unsupported with older providers. Existing matrix state/item wire layouts remain unchanged.",
    "The single shared provider calls original NSMatrix selectCell:/performClick: or NSButton performClick:. The shared host action guard protects the native dispatch stack against destruction and reentry. It creates no mouse/key event, copies no control algorithm and does not move input focus.",
    "IPC operation 47 reuses the exact 56-byte item request. Its reserved field retains the existing transport request sequence; unused dimensions/text must be zero. Only the creating connection can activate its idle control. Original native enabled/member state and typed action/key/selection snapshots supply the result.",
    "Blink original HTMLLabelElement::DefaultEventHandler owns association, interactive-content/selection filtering and focus. Only its original Node::DispatchSimulatedClick call with the currently scoped trusted source event enters native activation. Scope and source-event arguments pass unchanged to the original function.",
    "Gecko original HTMLLabelElement::PostHandleEvent owns association, disabled/drag/modifier/cancellation filtering and focus. Original static Element::DispatchClickEvent preserves pointer metadata and DOM activation. The wrapper recognizes the currently scoped trusted source event and passes original full-dispatch/flags/status arguments unchanged.",
    "Shared RadioBinding consumes the typed native action state. Existing original engine membership/lifetime validators choose the target; original click preactivation, events and cancellation/rollback remain engine-owned. Programmatic untrusted label clicks retain the original application-model path and update native pixels through normal model synchronization.",
    "No browser/AppKit/backend/installed runtime binary changed. The candidates are small adapters and one shared NativeUI provider/loader/shim build. GTK/Qt/KDE can reuse the semantic activation operation; toolbar/address bar/tabs remain original."
  ]
